#: kaccess.cpp:765
msgid ""
"These AccessX settings are needed for some users with motion impairments and "
"can be configured in the KDE Control Center. You can also turn them on and "
"off with standardized keyboard gestures.\n"
"\n"
"If you do not need them, you can select \"Deactivate all AccessX features "
"and gestures\"."
msgstr ""

#: kaccess.cpp:782
msgid ""
"Slow keys has been enabled. From now on, you need to press each key a "
"certain time before it gets accepted."
msgstr ""

#: kaccess.cpp:784
msgid "Slow keys has been disabled."
msgstr "Malrapidaj klavoj estis malebligitaj."

#: kaccess.cpp:787
msgid ""
"Bounce keys has been enabled. From now on, each key will be blocked a "
"certain time after it was used."
msgstr ""

#: kaccess.cpp:789
msgid "Bounce keys has been disabled."
msgstr ""

#: kaccess.cpp:792
msgid ""
"Sticky keys has been enabled. From now on, modifier keys will stay latched "
"after you have released them."
msgstr ""

#: kaccess.cpp:794
msgid "Sticky keys has been disabled."
msgstr ""

#: kaccess.cpp:797
msgid ""
"Mouse keys has been enabled. From now on, you can use the number pad of your "
"keyboard in order to control the mouse."
msgstr ""

#: kaccess.cpp:799
msgid "Mouse keys has been disabled."
msgstr "Musklavoj nun estas malebligitaj."

